combinedFragment=Explicit: save a place from the form~f1 R P
R-&gt;&gt;&gt;UI : onSavePlaceClicked() label "school", "York University Station"; on=UI
UI-&gt;&gt;&gt;TC : savePlace("school", "York University Station"); on=TC
TC-&gt;&gt;&gt;PR : resolve(stopQuery)
PR.&gt;TC : List&lt;Stop&gt;
combinedFragment=alt~f2 R P
R:[exactly one stop]
TC-&gt;&gt;&gt;REPO : load()
REPO.&gt;TC : p
